&_nc_oc=AdpiEnEEdMPCpL1AczeZ5893NPwK3yfl6VXEUDUoDOieTRMRRwZts2Yaz2ZsPty5Z5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJH0FxqQYnbhTQylnTVafYDAHm8rsZ6xTRJOZky2xySmg&oe=6AB6903E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SK7VRDHHVtUQ7kNvwFNn1lY&_nc_oc=Adpxf66E4TlDCpEJ--sGALsNOiegDVlCqiG8ITOuSkmvx8rW0SwEelkv336c4qV6i24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJc4kx92wv1paR-l4hT8ZYMlprI1CmIHr2wpl-tcS24xw&oe=6AB668FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kfhfeTMSHEYQ7kNvwFWT1DU&_nc_oc=Adq4dtrCspizoCk8YI0r86qgDcBctgdUaPA4iIMhhHefw3hDzvcC-2TJbVQ_87nwcEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLZM83Q7wuO2WY3rCaCpTHT5gw-CW6Jdq69PFKqwDdtgQ&oe=6AB68787"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FcGnVi-crz0Q7kNvwFTJIqI&_nc_oc=Adreq4J0-REdNS4MAN6OeYzZT8jvwFRewo9l8Bg29pu2F852VbB40RgtY11ak28VN7c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIeJKtZv4cOet2zRknf7MJbD8f9pDE8D-FWaOBE_3JTRQ&oe=6AB67355"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g2qzN5FFi-0Q7kNvwEyvRyt&_nc_oc=Adp9Q57Upn_saRIlAnfpYu5N7_UumAANadJonS0x1882BdOW8r9BA-MnoBdvMPl5yrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKzwZ8Hz_Yx31ELvB_5_vdksAs5Z05T9rwTenpAIAquvA&oe=6AB67FE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.